Q3 (VSS VSS Z) sky130_fd_pr__pnp_05v5_W0p68L0p68 m=1
Q4 (VSS Z net1) sky130_fd_pr__pnp_05v5_W0p68L0p68 m=1
R1 (Y net1) resistor r=1k
R2 (Vout Y) resistor r=1k
X1 (VSS X Y VG Z) opamp
